# Student Engagement Detection

## Project Description
Student Engagement Detection is a deep learning project that detects the engagement level of a student from an uploaded image.

The project uses a Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) built with TensorFlow and Keras. A Streamlit web application is used to provide a simple interface for testing the trained model.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- TensorFlow
- Keras
- NumPy
- Pillow
- Streamlit

